mson Sample in ‘Power’ Sparks Lawsuit Against Universal Music", "url": "https://au.variety.com/2022/music/news/universal-music-kanye-west-king-crimson-lawsuit-2159"}, {"title": "umg kanye west power lawsuit", "url": "https://afrotech.com/listicle/umg-kanye-west-power-lawsuit/"}, {"title": "Lawsuit Over Kanye West’s 2010 Track ‘Power’ Sample Dispute Settles Ahead of Trial", "url": "https://thesource.com/?p=718229"}, {"title": "www.digitalmusicnews.com", "url": "https://www.digitalmusicnews.com/?p=290993"}, {"title": "sites.create.ou.edu", "url": "https://sites.create.ou.edu/avrblog/2024/09/05/power"}, {"title": "Lawsuit Over Kanye West’s King Crimson Sample in 2010 Track ‘Power’ Settles Ahead of Trial", "url": "https://malaysia.news.yahoo.com/lawsuit-over-kanye-west-king-193535923.html"}, {"title": "Universal Music Group Settles King Crimson Royalty Lawsuit Over Kanye West’s “Power”", "url": "https://music.mxdwn.com/2024/05/20/news/universal-music-group-settles-king-crimson-royalty-lawsuit-over-kanye-wests-power/amp/"}, {"title": "music.mxdwn.com", "url": "https://music.mxdwn.com/?p=388972"}, {"title": "Universal Music hit with lawsuit for Kanye West's 'Power' - News - Mixmag", "url": "https://mixmag.net/read/universal-music-lawsuit-for-kanye-west-power-news"}, {"title": "King Crimson Sues Kanye West for Sample Use on \"Power\"27.04.2022", "url": "https://papaya.rocks/en/news/king-crimson-wytacza-proces-kanye-westowi-poszlo-o-sampel"}]}, {"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_014doQCjr4kQPDaRU4rC95qj", "content": [{"title": "Robert Fripp", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Fripp"}, {"title": "Robert Fripp", "url": "https://Wikipedia.com/wiki/Robert_Fripp"}, {"title": "graphsearch.epfl.ch", "url": "https://graphsearch.epfl.ch/en/concept/25893"}, {"title": "Robert Fripp: Age, Net Worth, Relationships, Family, Career Highlights, and More", "url": "https://mabumbe.com/people/?p=20455"}, {"title": "robert fripp", "url": "https://events.musicofourdesire.com/artist/robert-fripp"}, {"title": "Richard Fripp Day", "url": "https://micklabriola.com/?p=13898"}, {"title": "robert fripp", "url": "https://watchnext.io/person/robert-fripp"}, {"title": "Static Wikipedia February 2008 (no images)", "url": "https://wikipedia2007.classicistranieri.com/r/o/b/Robert_Fripp_bbc4.html"}, {"title": "Robert Fripp bbc4", "url": "https://wikipedia.classicistranieri.com/en/articles/r/o/b/Robert_Fripp_bbc4.html"}, {"title": "dev.bestclassicbands.com", "url": "https://dev.bestclassicbands.com/?p=2249"}]}, "Here's what the search turned up on both parts of your query.\n\n**The sample and the lawsuit:** Kanye West's 2010 single \"Power\" uses a vocal sample from King Crimson's \"21st Century Schizoid Man,\" which the song prominently features. The track also drew on other samples, with the rapper building it around three songs, one of them King Crimson's. Declan Colgan Music Ltd, which holds the mechanical rights to the King Crimson song, sued Universal Music Group in London's High Court in March 2022, claiming it underpaid streaming royalties. The case was due for trial in the U.K. but settled out of court, with the terms undisclosed, though Variety understands the publisher received a payment. Reports of the settlement appeared in May 2024.\n\n**Robert Fripp:** Robert Fripp was born on 16 May 1946 and is an English musician, composer, record producer, and author, best known as the guitarist, founder and only constant member of the progressive rock band King Crimson. He was born in Wimborne Minster, a town in Dorset, England. Fripp also commented publicly on the dispute, saying the dispute had been dragging on for several years, unnecessarily in his view."], "durationSeconds": 6.3848688330000005, "searchCount": 2}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_011HhT7MSW6x8zoA9yDbmZDZ", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
